    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface chemical, meteorological and physical data collected from Plataforma de Observaci\u00c3\u00b3n del Sistema Acoplado Oc\u00c3\u00a9ano Atm\u00c3\u00b3sfera (POSAR) Mooring POSAR_73W_36S time series observations in the subtropical South-Eastern Pacific Coast from 2016-06-06 to 2017-08-10. These data include measurements of partial pressure of carbon dioxide (pCO2), barometric pressure, sea surface temperature and sea surface salinity. These data were collected by Rene Garreaud of Universidad de Chile and Laura Far\u00c3\u00adas of Universidad de Concepci\u00c3\u00b3n, Chile.",
